---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy · Blu Baby Show" description="How Blu Baby Show collects, uses and protects your information.">
  <section class="section legal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Blu Baby Show</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: 15 November 2026</p>

      <p>This policy explains what information Blu Baby Show ("we", "us") collects when you use
        <strong>blubabyshow.com</strong> or buy from the Blu Shop, how we use it, and the choices you have.
        We keep it short and plain, because you're a busy parent.</p>

      <h2>1. What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Email address</strong>: when you join our newsletter, or when you buy a product (so we can send your download).</li>
        <li><strong>Order details</strong>: what you bought, the price, and the date. Our payment partner tells us this after you pay.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage data</strong>: anonymous information about how the site is used (pages visited, clicks, device and browser type, approximate country), collected through cookies and similar tools.</li>
        <li><strong>Messages</strong>: anything you send us by email.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We <strong>never</strong> see or store your card, UPI or bank details. Payments are handled entirely by our payment partner (see section 4).</p>

      <h2>2. How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To deliver what you bought and send your download link and receipt.</li>
        <li>To send our newsletter, if you signed up. Every email has a one-tap unsubscribe link.</li>
        <li>To answer your questions and handle refunds.</li>
        <li>To understand which pages and products are useful, and to measure our ads.</li>
        <li>To prevent fraud and meet legal and tax obligations.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information to anyone.</p>

      <h2>3. Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>We use a small number of tools that set cookies or similar identifiers:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>PostHog</strong>: site analytics (page views, clicks).</li>
        <li><strong>Meta Pixel</strong> (Facebook / Instagram): to measure whether our ads lead to visits and purchases.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings at any time. The site still works without them.</p>

      <h2>4. Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>We share information only with the service providers that help us run the shop, and only as much as they need:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Dodo Payments</strong>: processes payments as our merchant of record and handles your payment details, receipts, taxes and refunds. Their own privacy policy applies to the payment.</li>
        <li><strong>Supabase</strong>: securely stores newsletter sign-ups.</li>
        <li><strong>Resend</strong>: sends our emails.</li>
        <li><strong>Vercel</strong>: hosts this website.</li>
        <li><strong>PostHog</strong> and <strong>Meta</strong>: analytics and ad measurement, as above.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We may also share information if the law requires it.</p>

      <h2>5. How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>Newsletter emails are kept until you unsubscribe. Order records are kept for as long as tax and accounting law requires.
        You can ask us to delete your information at any time (see section 7).</p>

      <h2>6. Children</h2>
      <p>Blu Baby Show makes content for families, but this website and shop are for <strong>parents and adults</strong>.
        We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 18. If you believe a child has given us
        their information, email us and we will delete it.</p>

      <h2>7. Your choices and rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to show you, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you, or to stop sending you emails.
        Just write to <a href="mailto:blubabyshow@gmail.com">blubabyshow@gmail.com</a>. We reply within 7 days.</p>

      <h2>8. Security</h2>
      <p>We use trusted providers with encryption in transit (HTTPS) and limit who can access your information.
        No system is perfectly secure, but we take reasonable care to protect it.</p>

      <h2>9. Changes</h2>
      <p>If we change this policy, we will update the date at the top of this page.</p>

      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>Blu Baby Show · <a href="mailto:blubabyshow@gmail.com">blubabyshow@gmail.com</a> · <a href="/contact">Contact page</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { padding-top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 2rem); max-width: 720px; }
  .legal h1 { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--blu-deep); }
  .legal ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .legal li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .legal a { color: var(--blu-d); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
